{"seq":3,"slug":"learning","title":"学习：只有观测，把参数估出来","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/hidden-markov-models/learning","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"baum-welch","title":"Baum-Welch 算法：从无标注序列估参数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/hidden-markov-models/learning/baum-welch","wordCount":1613,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"em-derivation","title":"EM 推导：为何 Baum-Welch 单调收敛","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/hidden-markov-models/learning/em-derivation","wordCount":1650,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"initialization-scaling","title":"初始化与数值缩放：让理论真正跑起来","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/hidden-markov-models/learning/initialization-scaling","wordCount":1707,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"学习-只有观测-把参数估出来\">学习：只有观测，把参数估出来</h1><p>前一章假设模型参数是天上掉下来的。现实里没人给你转移矩阵——你手上只有一堆观测序列，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda=(A,B,\\pi)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 全是未知数，连隐状态的取值都看不到。这一章解决 Rabiner 三大问题里最难的那个：学习。</p>\n<p>难点在于，如果知道隐状态序列，参数估计只是数频次；如果知道参数，隐状态可以用推断章的方法算出后验——但两者都不知道，成了鸡生蛋。Baum-Welch 算法用期望最大化（EM）打破这个死循环：先猜一组参数，用它算隐状态的后验期望（E 步，直接调用前向后向），再用这些期望当作「软标签」重新估参数（M 步），反复迭代直到似然不再上升。</p>\n<p>第一篇讲 Baum-Welch 的具体更新公式，第二篇从通用 EM 出发严格推导它为什么单调收敛、M 步的闭式解怎么用拉格朗日乘子导出，第三篇处理把算法真正跑起来的数值现实：概率连乘的下溢、随机初始化对局部最优的影响、以及状态标签置换问题。三篇合起来，就是从「一堆没标注的序列」到「一个可用模型」的完整链路。前置是读完<a href=\"../inference/\">推断章</a>，尤其是<a href=\"../inference/posterior-marginals\">后验边缘</a>那篇的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ξ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\xi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n"}